    "Made with Natural Earth. Free vector and raster map data at naturalearthdata.com. Natural Earth I land cover raster for the Terrain card.": {
      "comment": "Credits: the Map data paragraph.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Made with Natural Earth. Free vector and raster map data at naturalearthdata.com. Natural Earth I land cover raster for the Terrain card."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Terrain card downloads AWS Terrain Tiles (Mapzen and the Registry of Open Data on AWS). ArcticDEM terrain data DEM(s) were created from DigitalGlobe, Inc., imagery and funded under National Science Foundation awards 1043681, 1559691, and 1542736. Australia terrain data © Commonwealth of Australia (Geoscience Australia) 2017. Austria terrain data © offene Daten Österreichs, Digitales Geländemodell (DGM) Österreich. Canada terrain data contains information licensed under the Open Government Licence – Canada. Europe terrain data produced using Copernicus data and information funded by the European Union, EU-DEM layers. Global ETOPO1 terrain data U.S. National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration. Mexico terrain data source: INEGI, Continental relief, 2016. New Zealand terrain data Copyright 2011 Crown copyright (c) Land Information New Zealand and the New Zealand Government. Norway terrain data © Kartverket. United Kingdom terrain data © Environment Agency copyright and/or database right 2015. All rights reserved. United States 3DEP (formerly NED) and global GMTED2010 and SRTM terrain data courtesy of the U.S. Geological Survey.": {
      "comment": "Credits: the Elevation paragraph.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Terrain card downloads AWS Terrain Tiles (Mapzen and the Registry of Open Data on AWS). ArcticDEM terrain data DEM(s) were created from DigitalGlobe, Inc., imagery and funded under National Science Foundation awards 1043681, 1559691, and 1542736. Australia terrain data © Commonwealth of Australia (Geoscience Australia) 2017. Austria terrain data © offene Daten Österreichs, Digitales Geländemodell (DGM) Österreich. Canada terrain data contains information licensed under the Open Government Licence – Canada. Europe terrain data produced using Copernicus data and information funded by the European Union, EU-DEM layers. Global ETOPO1 terrain data U.S. National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration. Mexico terrain data source: INEGI, Continental relief, 2016. New Zealand terrain data Copyright 2011 Crown copyright (c) Land Information New Zealand and the New Zealand Government. Norway terrain data © Kartverket. United Kingdom terrain data © Environment Agency copyright and/or database right 2015. All rights reserved. United States 3DEP (formerly NED) and global GMTED2010 and SRTM terrain data courtesy of the U.S. Geological Survey."
          }
        }
      }
